    "title": "Futbol Online",
    "description": "Futbol Online is the ideal application for all those who love this passion. It allows us to follow all the Soccer matches, so that you don't miss any results.\r\n\r\nYou will be able to enjoy the best of football from your smartphone or tablet online, whether they are from the main Leagues in the WORLD! A superior option so that you are informed wherever you are regardless of what you are doing.\r\n\r\nTeams, results, positions, scorers and more. All in one place. Check the match schedule in your country's time (GMT-2 Argentina/Uruguay) and follow your favorite team on your device anytime, anywhere.",
